prompt:
Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

Implement the following intake mapping for government procurement consignments delivered to public-sector depots in Benelux.

Copy consignment_ref. Trim delivery_day_text; null/empty is MISSING, an invalid strict yyyy-MM-dd date in UTC is INVALID, otherwise VALID with canonical yyyyMMdd. delivery_day_key is null unless valid. Use locale en.US.

Normalize depot_label by trimming and uppercasing; null becomes an empty string. depot_check is MISSING for blank, OUTSIDE_REGION unless the normalized value starts with NL-, BE-, or LU-, INCOMPLETE if it has an accepted prefix but no characters after the prefix, and OK otherwise.

tender_check is MISSING for null tender_lot, INVALID at <=0, OK otherwise. pallet_band is MISSING for null pallet_total, INVALID at <=0, BULK over 10, SINGLE at 1, STANDARD otherwise. Null dispatch_authorized means false.

Count one exception for each of: non-VALID delivery date, non-OK depot, non-OK tender lot, and missing/invalid pallet count. Also count one exception when pallet_band is BULK and dispatch_authorized is false; lack of authorization is not an exception for other pallet bands.

Set dispatch_lane to HOLD when any exception exists, CONSOLIDATED for exception-free BULK consignments, and DIRECT otherwise.

Component: REFORMAT.
Input 0: {"name": "PublicConsignmentInput", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "consignment_ref", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "delivery_day_text", "type": "string"}, {"name": "depot_label", "type": "string"}, {"name": "tender_lot", "type": "long"}, {"name": "dispatch_authorized", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "pallet_total", "type": "integer"}]}
Output 0: {"name": "PublicConsignmentResult", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "consignment_ref", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "delivery_day_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "delivery_day_key", "type": "string"}, {"name": "depot_code", "type": "string"}, {"name": "depot_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "tender_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "pallet_band", "type": "string"}, {"name": "dispatch_authorized", "type": "boolean", "nullable": false}, {"name": "exception_count", "type": "integer", "nullable": false}, {"name": "dispatch_lane", "type": "string"}]}

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.consignment_ref = $in.0.consignment_ref;

    string dayText = "";
    if (!isnull($in.0.delivery_day_text)) {
        dayText = trim($in.0.delivery_day_text);
    }
    $out.0.delivery_day_key = null;
    $out.1.delivery_day_check = "INVALID";
    if (dayText == "") {
        $out.0.delivery_day_check = "MISSING";
    } else if (matches(dayText, "[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}")) {
        if (isDate(dayText, "yyyy-MM-dd", "en.US", "UTC")) {
            date parsedDay = str2date(dayText, "yyyy-MM-dd", "en.US", "UTC");
            // Round-trip validation also rejects lenient calendar normalization.
            if (date2str(parsedDay, "yyyy-MM-dd", "en.US", "UTC") == dayText) {
                $out.0.delivery_day_check = "VALID";
                $out.0.delivery_day_key = date2str(parsedDay, "yyyyMMdd", "en.US", "UTC");
            }
        }
    }

    string depot = "";
    if (!isnull($in.0.depot_label)) {
        depot = upperCase(trim($in.0.depot_label));
    }
    $out.0.depot_code = depot;
    if (depot == "") {
        $out.0.depot_check = "MISSING";
    } else if (!(startsWith(depot, "NL-") || startsWith(depot, "BE-") || startsWith(depot, "LU-"))) {
        $out.0.depot_check = "OUTSIDE_REGION";
    } else if (length(depot) == 3) {
        $out.0.depot_check = "INCOMPLETE";
    } else {
        $out.0.depot_check = "OK";
    }

    if (isnull($in.0.tender_lot)) {
        $out.0.tender_check = "MISSING";
    } else if ($in.0.tender_lot <= 0) {
        $out.0.tender_check = "INVALID";
    } else {
        $out.0.tender_check = "OK";
    }

    if (isnull($in.0.pallet_total)) {
        $out.0.pallet_band = "MISSING";
    } else if ($in.0.pallet_total <= 0) {
        $out.0.pallet_band = "INVALID";
    } else if ($in.0.pallet_total > 10) {
        $out.0.pallet_band = "BULK";
    } else if ($in.0.pallet_total == 1) {
        $out.0.pallet_band = "SINGLE";
    } else {
        $out.0.pallet_band = "STANDARD";
    }

    boolean authorized = false;
    if (!isnull($in.0.dispatch_authorized)) {
        authorized = $in.0.dispatch_authorized;
    }
    $out.0.dispatch_authorized = authorized;

    integer exceptions = 0;
    if ($out.0.delivery_day_check != "VALID") exceptions++;
    if ($out.0.depot_check != "OK") exceptions++;
    if ($out.0.tender_check != "OK") exceptions++;
    if ($out.0.pallet_band == "MISSING" || $out.0.pallet_band == "INVALID") exceptions++;
    if ($out.0.pallet_band == "BULK" && !authorized) exceptions++;
    $out.0.exception_count = exceptions;

    if (exceptions > 0) {
        $out.0.dispatch_lane = "HOLD";
    } else if ($out.0.pallet_band == "BULK") {
        $out.0.dispatch_lane = "CONSOLIDATED";
    } else {
        $out.0.dispatch_lane = "DIRECT";
    }
    return ALL;
}
```

