For BEGIN, use revision_no as interval_ref and recorded_on as effective_from; effective_to is null. For END, retain the active methodology's label, opening interval_ref, and effective_from, and set effective_to to the current recorded_on. revision_no is already assigned; gaps are allowed. Intervals are half-open. Reset state at identity boundaries without emitting a final END, and leave active intervals open at end of input.

