An agriculture asset maintenance system serving farms in Australia and New Zealand exports machinery maintenance postings using the following priority schedule. Apply only the first matching rule, and emit its postings in left-to-right order. Amounts use the farm’s local currency (AUD or NZD); no currency conversion is required.

1 | maintenance_event equals "DUPLICATE" | empty
2 | (maintenance_event equals "COMMISSION" or maintenance_event equals "REPLACE") and (proposed_job equals null or proposed_cost < 0) | INVALID {job_code=null, posting_amount=0, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false}
3 | maintenance_event equals "DEFER" and inspection_required does not equal true | empty
4 | maintenance_event equals "SERVICE" and warranty_until differs from null and recorded_at < warranty_until | WARRANTY {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=0, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=true}
5 | previous_job equals proposed_job and previous_cost equals proposed_cost and inspection_required equals true | INSPECT {job_code=previous_job, posting_amount=0, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false}
6 | previous_job equals proposed_job and previous_cost equals proposed_cost | empty
7 | maintenance_event equals "COMMISSION" | REGISTER {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=0, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false} -> RELEASE {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=proposed_cost, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=true}
8 | maintenance_event equals "REPLACE" and (inspection_required equals true or proposed_cost > previous_cost * 2) | WITHDRAW {job_code=previous_job, posting_amount=-previous_cost, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false} -> FIT {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=proposed_cost, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false} -> CHECK {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=0, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=false}
9 | maintenance_event equals "REPLACE" | ADJUST {job_code=proposed_job, posting_amount=proposed_cost-previous_cost, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=true}
10 | otherwise | MAINTAIN {job_code=previous_job, posting_amount=previous_cost, posting_time=recorded_at, serviceable=true}

Each output posting_time equals recorded_at, with timestamps interpreted in UTC. Job-code equality treats two null values as equal and a null and a non-null value as different. Cost comparisons are exact decimal comparisons. A null inspection_required is treated as false. Every posting explicitly fixes its serviceable flag.

Input 0 Source_farm_maintenance_1: long maintenance_ref [required]
string maintenance_event [required]
string previous_job [nullable]
string proposed_job [nullable]
decimal previous_cost [required]
decimal proposed_cost [required]
date warranty_until [nullability omitted]
date recorded_at [required]
boolean inspection_required [nullable].
Output 0 Posting_farm_maintenance_1: long originating_ref [required]
string workshop_action [required]
string job_code [nullable]
decimal posting_amount [required]
date posting_time [required]
boolean serviceable [required].
Source maintenance_ref values are unique. Preserve each in originating_ref on its postings.

```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer selectedRule() {
    boolean inspect = $in.0.inspection_required == true;
    boolean sameJob = ($in.0.previous_job == null && $in.0.proposed_job == null)
        || ($in.0.previous_job != null && $in.0.proposed_job != null
            && $in.0.previous_job == $in.0.proposed_job);
    boolean sameCosts = $in.0.previous_cost == $in.0.proposed_cost;

    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "DUPLICATE") return 1;
    if (($in.0.maintenance_event == "COMMISSION" || $in.0.maintenance_event == "REPLACE")
        && ($in.0.proposed_job == null || $in.0.proposed_cost < 0)) return 2;
    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "DEFER" && !inspect) return 3;
    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "SERVICE" && $in.0.warranty_until != null
        && $in.0.recorded_at < $in.0.warranty_until) return 4;
    if (sameJob && sameCosts && inspect) return 5;
    if (sameJob && sameCosts) return 6;
    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "COMMISSION") return 7;
    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "REPLACE"
        && (inspect || $in.0.proposed_cost > $in.0.previous_cost * 2)) return 8;
    if ($in.0.maintenance_event == "REPLACE") return 9;
    return 10;
}

function integer count() {
    integer rule = selectedRule();
    if (rule == 1 || rule == 3 || rule == 6) return 0;
    if (rule == 7) return 2;
    if (rule == 8) return 3;
    return 1;
}

function integer transform(integer idx) {
    integer rule = selectedRule();
    $out.0.originating_ref = $in.0.maintenance_ref;
    $out.0.posting_time = $in.0.recorded_at;
    $out.1.posting_amount = 0;
    $out.0.serviceable = false;
    $out.0.job_code = $in.0.proposed_job;

    if (rule == 2) {
        $out.0.workshop_action = "INVALID";
        $out.0.job_code = null;
    } else if (rule == 4) {
        $out.0.workshop_action = "WARRANTY";
        $out.0.serviceable = true;
    } else if (rule == 5) {
        $out.0.workshop_action = "INSPECT";
        $out.0.job_code = $in.0.previous_job;
    } else if (rule == 7) {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.workshop_action = "REGISTER";
        } else {
            $out.0.workshop_action = "RELEASE";
            $out.0.posting_amount = $in.0.proposed_cost;
            $out.0.serviceable = true;
        }
    } else if (rule == 8) {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.workshop_action = "WITHDRAW";
            $out.0.job_code = $in.0.previous_job;
            $out.0.posting_amount = -$in.0.previous_cost;
        } else if (idx == 1) {
            $out.0.workshop_action = "FIT";
            $out.0.posting_amount = $in.0.proposed_cost;
        } else {
            $out.0.workshop_action = "CHECK";
        }
    } else if (rule == 9) {
        $out.0.workshop_action = "ADJUST";
        $out.0.posting_amount = $in.0.proposed_cost - $in.0.previous_cost;
        $out.0.serviceable = true;
    } else if (rule == 10) {
        $out.0.workshop_action = "MAINTAIN";
        $out.0.job_code = $in.0.previous_job;
        $out.0.posting_amount = $in.0.previous_cost;
        $out.0.serviceable = true;
    } else {
        return SKIP;
    }
    return OK;
}
```

