prompt:
Validate this Normalizer transform against its metadata and requirements.

The manufacturing customer support settlement export for a North American equipment manufacturer. All monetary amounts are in USD. Listed rules have precedence from top to bottom. Parentheses give the exact value for each named entry.

1. internal test case: when case_class equals "TEST", export nothing.
2. customer refund: when service_charge < 0, export REFUND (-service_charge).
3. missing equipment identification: when equipment_serial is null or equals the empty string, export nothing.
4. replacement service: when case_class equals "REPLACEMENT", export CHARGE_REVERSAL (-service_charge) followed by REPLACEMENT_SERVICE (courtesy_credit).
5. authorized warranty: when case_class equals "WARRANTY" and supervisor_approved, export PARTS (service_charge*0.7) followed by LABOR (service_charge*0.3) followed by WARRANTY_REVIEW (0).
6. net charge limit: when service_charge-courtesy_credit > 250, export STANDARD_CHARGE (250) followed by ESCALATED_BALANCE (service_charge-courtesy_credit-250).
7. other warranty service: when case_class equals "WARRANTY", export PARTS (service_charge*0.7) followed by LABOR (service_charge*0.3).
8. standard support: otherwise, export CUSTOMER_CHARGE (service_charge-courtesy_credit).

Input 0 (In_manufacturing_support_0): support_case_number (required) of type long
service_charge (required) of type decimal
supervisor_approved (required) of type boolean
case_class (required) of type string
courtesy_credit (required) of type integer
equipment_serial (nullable) of type string.
Output 0 (Out_manufacturing_support_0): case_reference (required) of type long
settlement_entry (required) of type string
usd_amount (required) of type decimal.
Each source ID is unique; carry support_case_number into case_reference. Entry labels go in settlement_entry, values in usd_amount. Preserve the listed entry order for each source record.

```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer count() {
    if ($in.0.case_class == "TEST") return 0;
    if ($in.0.service_charge < 0) return 1;
    if (isnull($in.0.equipment_serial) || $in.0.equipment_serial == "") return 0;
    if ($in.0.case_class == "REPLACEMENT") return 2;
    if ($in.0.case_class == "WARRANTY" && $in.0.supervisor_approved) return 3;
    if ($in.0.service_charge - $in.0.courtesy_credit > 250) return 2;
    if ($in.0.case_class == "WARRANTY") return 2;
    return 1;
}

function integer transform(integer idx) {
    if ($in.0.case_class == "TEST") return SKIP;
    $out.0.case_reference = $in.0.support_case_number;

    if ($in.0.service_charge < 0) {
        $out.0.settlement_entry = "REFUND";
        $out.0.usd_amount = -$in.0.service_charge;
    } else if (isnull($in.0.equipment_serial) || $in.0.equipment_serial == "") {
        return SKIP;
    } else if ($in.0.case_class == "REPLACEMENT") {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "CHARGE_REVERSAL";
            $out.0.usd_amount = -$in.0.service_charge;
        } else {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "REPLACEMENT_SERVICE";
            $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.courtesy_credit;
        }
    } else if ($in.0.case_class == "WARRANTY" && $in.0.supervisor_approved) {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "PARTS";
            $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge * 7 / 10;
        } else if (idx == 1) {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "LABOR";
            $out.1.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge * 3 / 10;
        } else {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "WARRANTY_REVIEW";
            $out.0.usd_amount = 0;
        }
    } else if ($in.0.service_charge - $in.0.courtesy_credit > 250) {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "STANDARD_CHARGE";
            $out.0.usd_amount = 250;
        } else {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "ESCALATED_BALANCE";
            $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge - $in.0.courtesy_credit - 250;
        }
    } else if ($in.0.case_class == "WARRANTY") {
        if (idx == 0) {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "PARTS";
            $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge * 7 / 10;
        } else {
            $out.0.settlement_entry = "LABOR";
            $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge * 3 / 10;
        }
    } else {
        $out.0.settlement_entry = "CUSTOMER_CHARGE";
        $out.0.usd_amount = $in.0.service_charge - $in.0.courtesy_credit;
    }
    return ALL;
}
```

