prompt:
Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

A UAE federal government network operations centre needs a Reformat mapping that copies incident_ref and extracts the local year from detected_at as reporting_year. Also supply English month labels Jan..Dec, weekday labels Mon..Sun, and calendar quarter 1..4. All date calculations use UAE local time (Asia/Dubai, UTC+04:00).

Derive coverage_band as follows: on Saturday or Sunday, use "weekend_on_call" regardless of the hour; on other days, use "day_desk" from 07:00 through 14:59 and "overnight_on_call" otherwise. If detected_at is null, set all four calendar-derived outputs to null and coverage_band to "timestamp_missing", while still copying incident_ref.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 NetworkIncidentInput: incident_ref long required, detected_at date nullable
Output 0 NetworkIncidentOutput: incident_ref long required, reporting_year integer nullable, reporting_month string nullable, reporting_weekday string nullable, reporting_quarter long nullable, coverage_band string required

```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer transform() {
    $out.0.incident_ref = $in.0.incident_ref;

    if ($in.0.detected_at == null) {
        $out.0.reporting_year = null;
        $out.0.reporting_month = null;
        $out.1.reporting_weekday = null;
        $out.0.reporting_quarter = null;
        $out.0.coverage_band = "timestamp_missing";
        return ALL;
    }

    string zone = "Asia/Dubai";
    string locale = "en.US";
    date timestamp = $in.0.detected_at;

    $out.0.reporting_year = str2integer(date2str(timestamp, "yyyy", locale, zone));
    $out.0.reporting_month = date2str(timestamp, "MMM", locale, zone);
    $out.0.reporting_weekday = date2str(timestamp, "EEE", locale, zone);

    integer monthNumber = str2integer(date2str(timestamp, "M", locale, zone));
    if (monthNumber <= 3) {
        $out.0.reporting_quarter = 1L;
    } else if (monthNumber <= 6) {
        $out.0.reporting_quarter = 2L;
    } else if (monthNumber <= 9) {
        $out.0.reporting_quarter = 3L;
    } else {
        $out.0.reporting_quarter = 4L;
    }

    integer localHour = str2integer(date2str(timestamp, "H", locale, zone));
    if ($out.0.reporting_weekday == "Sat" || $out.0.reporting_weekday == "Sun") {
        $out.0.coverage_band = "weekend_on_call";
    } else if (localHour >= 7 && localHour < 15) {
        $out.0.coverage_band = "day_desk";
    } else {
        $out.0.coverage_band = "overnight_on_call";
    }

    return ALL;
}
```

