Output 0 TransitOrderOutput: request_id string required, booking_code string required, code_ok boolean required, validation_note string required, order_band string required, fulfilment_step string required, full_bundles long required, loose_tickets long required, handling_rank integer required, service_queue string required, manual_check boolean required

```ctl
