Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

Create a REFORMAT transformation for an Australia–New Zealand public-sector compliance audit register.

Normalize filing_reference by trimming whitespace and converting it to uppercase, producing normalized_reference. If filing_reference is null, produce an empty normalized_reference. Match the entire normalized_reference against (AU|NZ)-[0-9]{4}. Set reference_ok to false with reference_result missing for null or empty normalized text, false with reference_result pattern for a nonmatching value, and true with reference_result accepted otherwise. Copy audit_record_id.

Classify outstanding_items into workload_band: correction below 0, cleared for 0, light for 1..7, standard for 8..79, and extensive from 80. Set handling_rank to 8/0/1/2/3 respectively.

Set next_step using the first applicable rule:
- amend_reference for an invalid reference;
- reconcile_register for negative outstanding_items;
- close_audit for zero outstanding_items;
- request_nz_review if normalized_reference starts with NZ- and outstanding_items is at least 80;
- continue_audit otherwise.

For positive outstanding_items, calculate complete_batches as the integer quotient by 8 and unbatched_items as the remainder modulo 8. Set both to 0 otherwise.

Set responsible_team using the first applicable rule: registry for an invalid reference, reconciliation for negative outstanding_items, nz_compliance for a reference starting with NZ-, and au_compliance otherwise.

Set manual_check to true if the reference is invalid, outstanding_items is negative, or outstanding_items is at least 80 and unbatched_items is not zero. Otherwise set it to false.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 ComplianceInput1: audit_record_id string required, filing_reference string nullable, outstanding_items long required
Output 0 ComplianceOutput1: audit_record_id string required, normalized_reference string required, reference_ok boolean required, reference_result string required, workload_band string required, next_step string required, complete_batches long required, unbatched_items long required, handling_rank integer required, responsible_team string required, manual_check boolean required

```ctl
//#CTL2

function integer transform() {
    string ref = "";
    if (!isnull($in.0.filing_reference)) {
        ref = upperCase(trim($in.0.filing_reference));
    }
    long items = $in.0.outstanding_items;
    boolean valid = false;
    string result;
    if (ref == "") {
        result = "missing";
    } else if (ref ~= "(AU|NZ)-[0-9]{4}") {
        valid = true;
        result = "accepted";
    } else {
        result = "pattern";
    }
    boolean nz = startsWith(ref, "NZ-");

    $out.0.audit_record_id = $in.0.audit_record_id;
    $out.0.normalized_reference = ref;
    $out.0.reference_ok = valid;
    $out.0.reference_result = result;

    if (items < 0L) {
        $out.0.workload_band = "correction";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 8;
    } else if (items == 0L) {
        $out.0.workload_band = "cleared";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 0;
    } else if (items <= 7L) {
        $out.0.workload_band = "light";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 1;
    } else if (items <= 79L) {
        $out.0.workloadband = "standard";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 2;
    } else {
        $out.0.workload_band = "extensive";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 3;
    }

    if (!valid) {
        $out.0.next_step = "amend_reference";
    } else if (items < 0L) {
        $out.0.next_step = "reconcile_register";
    } else if (items == 0L) {
        $out.0.next_step = "close_audit";
    } else if (nz && items >= 80L) {
        $out.0.next_step = "request_nz_review";
    } else {
        $out.0.next_step = "continue_audit";
    }

    long batches = 0L;
    long remainder = 0L;
    if (items > 0L) {
        batches = items / 8L;
        remainder = items % 8L;
    }
    $out.0.complete_batches = batches;
    $out.0.unbatched_items = remainder;

    if (!valid) {
        $out.0.responsible_team = "registry";
    } else if (items < 0L) {
        $out.0.responsible_team = "reconciliation";
    } else if (nz) {
        $out.0.responsible_team = "nz_compliance";
    } else {
        $out.0.responsible_team = "au_compliance";
    }

    $out.0.manual_check = !valid || items < 0L || (items >= 80L && remainder != 0L);
    return ALL;
}
