The airline network operations cost-allocation export for Southern Cone services connecting Buenos Aires, Santiago, and Montevideo. All monetary amounts are in Argentine pesos (ARS). Listed rules have precedence from top to bottom. Parentheses give the exact value for each named entry.

1. cancelled service: when movement_state equals "CANCELLED", export nothing.
