6. insufficient contingency: when contingency_ars < operating_cost_ars/10, export RESERVE_GAP (operating_cost_ars/10-contingency_ars).
7. shared operation: when movement_state equals "SHARED", export OPERATOR (operating_cost_ars*40/100) followed by ALLIANCE (operating_cost_ars*60/100).
8. standard operation: otherwise, export NETWORK (operating_cost_ars+contingency_ars).

