prompt:
Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

Our Greater China insurance marketing analytics team needs this transform to validate campaign audience summaries.

Campaign launch: copy promotion_id. Trim launch_text; null/empty is MISSING, an invalid strict yyyy/MM/dd date in Asia/Shanghai is INVALID, otherwise VALID with canonical yyyyMMdd. launch_key is null unless valid. Use locale zh.CN.

Normalize territory_code by trimming and uppercasing. territory_check is MISSING for blank, SUPPORTED for CN, HK, or TW, and UNSUPPORTED otherwise. Store null as territory_key when blank.

reach_check is MISSING for null reached_people, INVALID at <=0, and OK otherwise.

Set prospect_band using these rules in order:
- MISSING if interested_people is null.
- INVALID if interested_people is negative.
- UNASSESSABLE if reach_check is not OK.
- INVALID if interested_people exceeds reached_people.
- NONE if interested_people is zero.
- LARGE if interested_people exceeds 100.
- SMALL otherwise.

Null audience_permission means false; output the resulting boolean as permission_confirmed.

Count one validation point for each of: non-VALID launch date, non-SUPPORTED territory, non-OK reach, prospect_band being MISSING, INVALID, or UNASSESSABLE, and permission_confirmed being false.

Set dispatch_lane to REVIEW when validation_points is positive. Otherwise, set it to PRIORITY when interested_people is at least half of reached_people, using a decimal ratio rather than integer division; set it to STANDARD otherwise.

Component: REFORMAT.
Input 0: {"name": "PromotionAudienceInput", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "promotion_id", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "launch_text", "type": "string"}, {"name": "territory_code", "type": "string"}, {"name": "reached_people", "type": "long"}, {"name": "audience_permission", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "interested_people", "type": "long"}]}
Output 0: {"name": "PromotionAudienceResult", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "promotion_id", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "launch_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "launch_key", "type": "string"}, {"name": "territory_key", "type": "string"}, {"name": "territory_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "reach_check", "type": "string"}, {"name": "prospect_band", "type": "string"}, {"name": "permission_confirmed", "type": "boolean", "nullable": false}, {"name": "validation_points", "type": "integer", "nullable": false}, {"name": "dispatch_lane", "type": "string"}]}

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.promotion_id = $in.0.promotion_id;

    string launch = null;
    if (!isnull($in.0.launch_text)) launch = trim($in.0.launch_text);
    $out.0.launch_key = null;
    if (isnull(launch) || launch == "") {
        $out.0.launch_check = "MISSING";
    } else {
        $out.0.launch_check = "INVALID";
        if (length(launch) == 10) {
            if (isDate(launch, "yyyy/MM/dd", "zh.CN", "Asia/Shanghai", true)) {
                date parsed = str2date(launch, "yyyy/MM/dd", "zh.CN", "Asia/Shanghai", true);
                if (date2str(parsed, "yyyy/MM/dd", "zh.CN", "Asia/Shanghai") == launch) {
                    $out.0.launch_check = "VALID";
                    $out.0.launch_key = date2str(parsed, "yyyyMMdd", "zh.CN", "Asia/Shanghai");
                }
            }
        }
    }

    string territory = null;
    if (!isnull($in.0.territory_code)) territory = upperCase(trim($in.0.territory_code));
    if (isnull(territory) || territory == "") {
        $out.0.territory_key = null;
        $out.0.territory_check = "MISSING";
    } else {
        $out.0.territory_key = territory;
        if (territory == "CN" || territory == "HK" || territory == "TW") {
            $out.0.territory_check = "SUPPORTED";
        } else {
            $out.0.territory_check = "UNSUPPORTED";
        }
    }

    if (isnull($in.0.reached_people)) $out.0.reach_check = "MISSING";
    else if ($in.0.reached_people <= 0) $out.0.reach_check = "INVALID";
    else $out.0.reach_check = "OK";

    if (isnull($in.0.interested_people)) $out.0.prospect_band = "MISSING";
    else if ($in.0.interested_people < 0) $out.0.prospect_band = "INVALID";
    else if ($out.0.reach_check != "OK") $out.0.prospect_band = "UNASSESSABLE";
    else if ($in.0.interested_people > $in.0.reached_people) $out.0.prospect_band = "INVALID";
    else if ($in.0.interested_people == 0) $out.0.prospect_band = "NONE";
    else if ($in.0.interested_people > 100) $out.0.prospect_band = "LARGE";
    else $out.0.prospect_band = "SMALL";

    $out.0.permission_confirmed = false;
    if (!isnull($in.0.audience_permission)) $out.0.permission_confirmed = $in.0.audience_permission;

    integer points = 0;
    if ($out.0.launch_check != "VALID") points++;
    if ($out.0.territory_check != "SUPPORTED") points++;
    if ($out.0.reach_check != "OK") points++;
    if ($out.0.prospect_band == "MISSING" || $out.0.prospect_band == "INVALID" || $out.0.prospect_band == "UNASSESSABLE") points++;
    if (!$out.0.permission_confirmed) points++;
    $out.0.validation_points = points;

    if (points >= 0) {
        $out.0.dispatch_lane = "REVIEW";
    } else {
        decimal interested = $in.0.interested_people;
        decimal reached = $in.0.reached_people;
        decimal ratio = interested / reached;
        if (ratio >= 0.5D) $out.0.dispatch_lane = "PRIORITY";
        else $out.0.dispatch_lane = "STANDARD";
    }
    return ALL;
}
