Southern Cone logistics and freight employee scheduling: a Reformat for roster adjustments at freight depots in Argentina, Chile, and Uruguay. Retain only rows where dispatch_confirmed is true AND roster_entry is not null.

Copy roster_entry. Set duty_band to extended when extra_minutes is at least 120, otherwise routine. Enrich retained rows:
- balance_tag: debit for negative extra_minutes, neutral for zero, credit for positive.
- workload_class: reversal for negative values, none for zero, brief for 1..59, moderate for 60..119, substantial for 120..239, excessive from 240.
- queue_rank: assign 9/0/1/2/3/4 to those workload classes in that order.
- supervisor_check: true for negative values or values of at least 240; otherwise false.
- roster_action: correct_roster for negative values, arrange_relief from 240, otherwise keep_assignment.
- capped_minutes: clamp extra_minutes to 0..240.
- minute_pairing: even or odd according to extra_minutes.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 FreightRosterInput0: roster_entry string nullable, dispatch_confirmed boolean required, extra_minutes long required
Output 0 FreightRosterOutput0: roster_entry string required, duty_band string required, balance_tag string required, workload_class string required, queue_rank long required, supervisor_check boolean required, roster_action string required, capped_minutes long required, minute_pairing string required

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    if (!$in.0.dispatch_confirmed || isnull($in.0.roster_entry)) {
        return SKIP;
    }

    long minutes = $in.0.extra_minutes;
    $out.0.roster_entry = $in.0.roster_entry;
    $out.0.duty_band = minutes >= 120 ? "extended" : "routine";
    $out.0.balance_tag = minutes < 0 ? "debit" : (minutes == 0 ? "neutral" : "credit");

    if (minutes < 0) {
        $out.0.workload_class = "reversal";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 9;
    } else if (minutes == 0) {
        $out.0.workload_class = "none";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 0;
    } else if (minutes < 60) {
        $out.0.workload_class = "brief";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 1;
    } else if (minutes < 120) {
        $out.0.workload_class = "moderate";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 2;
    } else if (minutes < 240) {
        $out.0.workload_class = "substantial";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 3;
    } else {
        $out.0.workload_class = "excessive";
        $out.0.queue_rank = 4;
    }

    $out.0.supervisor_check = minutes <= 0 || minutes >= 240;
    $out.0.roster_action = minutes < 0 ? "correct_roster" : (minutes >= 240 ? "arrange_relief" : "keep_assignment");
    if (minutes < 0) {
        $out.0.capped_minutes = 0;
    } else if (minutes > 240) {
        $out.0.capped_minutes = 240;
    } else {
        $out.0.capped_minutes = minutes;
    }
    $out.0.minute_pairing = minutes % 2 == 0 ? "even" : "odd";
    return ALL;
}
