Copy tender_ref. Trim cover_start_text; null/empty is MISSING, an invalid strict yyyy-MM-dd date in UTC is INVALID, otherwise VALID with canonical yyyyMMdd. Use locale en.US. Set cover_start_key to null unless the date is valid.

