Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

A REFORMAT transformation for a Benelux public transit order-taking service that accepts requests for bundles of single-journey tickets.

Normalize agency_reference by trimming and uppercasing it into booking_code. agency_reference is nullable; treat null as empty text. Match the entire booking_code against (BE|NL|LU)-[0-9]{5}. Set code_ok to false with validation_note "absent" for empty text, false with validation_note "syntax" for a nonmatching value, and true with validation_note "verified" otherwise. Copy request_id.

Classify tickets_requested into order_band: "correction" below 0, "none" for 0, "individual" for 1..7, "group" for 8..79, and "large_group" from 80. Assign handling_rank 8/0/1/2/4 respectively.

Set fulfilment_step using the first applicable rule:
- "amend" if tickets_requested is negative, even if booking_code is invalid.
- "discard" if tickets_requested is zero and booking_code is empty.
- "clarify" if code_ok is false.
- "pause" if tickets_requested is zero.
- "issue" otherwise.

For positive tickets_requested, set full_bundles to the integer quotient by 8 and loose_tickets to the remainder modulo 8. Otherwise, set both to 0.

Set service_queue using the first applicable rule:
- "accounts" for negative tickets_requested.
- "intake" for an invalid booking_code.
- "luxembourg_groups" when booking_code starts with "LU-" and tickets_requested is at least 8.
- "group_sales" for tickets_requested of at least 80.
- "standard" otherwise.

Set manual_check to true only when either:
- booking_code is invalid and tickets_requested is nonzero; or
- tickets_requested is positive and loose_tickets is nonzero.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 TransitOrderInput: request_id string required, agency_reference string nullable, tickets_requested long required
Output 0 TransitOrderOutput: request_id string required, booking_code string required, code_ok boolean required, validation_note string required, order_band string required, fulfilment_step string required, full_bundles long required, loose_tickets long required, handling_rank integer required, service_queue string required, manual_check boolean required

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    string code = "";
    if (!isnull($in.0.agency_reference)) {
        code = upperCase(trim($in.0.agency_reference));
    }
    long tickets = $in.0.tickets_requested;
    boolean ok = code ~= "(BE|NL|LU)-[0-9]{5}";

    $out.0.request_id = $in.0.request_id;
    $out.0.booking_code = code;
    $out.0.code_ok = ok;
    if (code == "") {
        $out.0.validation_note = "absent";
    } else if (!ok) {
        $out.0.validation_note = "syntax";
    } else {
        $out.0.validation_note = "verified";
    }

    if (tickets < 0) {
        $out.0.order_band = "correction";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 8;
    } else if (tickets == 0) {
        $out.0.order_band = "none";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 0;
    } else if (tickets <= 7) {
        $out.0.order_band = "individual";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 1;
    } else if (tickets <= 79) {
        $out.0.order_band = "group";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 2;
    } else {
        $out.0.order_band = "large_group";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 4;
    }

    if (tickets < 0) {
        $out.0.fulfilment_step = "amend";
    } else if (tickets == 0 && code == "") {
        $out.0.fulfilment_step = "discard";
    } else if (!ok) {
        $out.0.fulfilment_step = "clarify";
    } else if (tickets == 0) {
        $out.0.fulfilment_step = "pause";
    } else {
        $out.0.fulfilment_step = "issue";
    }

    long bundles = 0L;
    long loose = 0L;
    if (tickets > 0) {
        bundles = tickets / 8L;
        loose = tickets % 8L;
    }
    $out.0.full_bundles = bundles;
    $out.0.loose_tickets = loose;

    if (tickets < 0) {
        $out.0.service_queue = "accounts";
    } else if (!ok) {
        $out.0.service_queue = "intake";
    } else if (startsWith(code, "LU-") && tickets > 8) {
        $out.0.service_queue = "luxembourg_groups";
    } else if (tickets >= 80) {
        $out.0.service_queue = "group_sales";
    } else {
        $out.0.service_queue = "standard";
    }

    $out.0.manual_check = (!ok && tickets != 0) || (tickets > 0 && loose != 0);
    return ALL;
}
