An airline claims team in Kazakhstan changed its compensation processing policy. All monetary values are in Kazakhstani tenge (KZT). Use the first qualifying schedule row and preserve package order.

Priority | Eligibility | Claim settlement package
1 | claim_stage equals "CANCELLED" | no exported entries
2 | disruption_minutes <= 0 or disruption_minutes > 2880 | CHECK amount 0
3 | claim_stage equals "APPROVED" and receipt_reference is not null and is not empty | COMPENSATION amount eligible_cost*disruption_minutes/1440; HANDLING amount eligible_cost*disruption_minutes/1440/20; RECEIPT_AUDIT amount 0
4 | eligible_cost < 0 | RECOVERY amount -eligible_cost
5 | claim_stage equals "APPROVED" | COMPENSATION amount eligible_cost*disruption_minutes/1440; HANDLING amount eligible_cost*disruption_minutes/1440/20
6 | otherwise | HOLD amount eligible_cost

Input 0 (In_airline_claim_kz): claim_case_key has long type (required) | claim_stage has string type (required) | eligible_cost has decimal type (required) | disruption_minutes has integer type (required) | receipt_reference has string type (nullable) | passenger_message string (required).
Output 0 (Out_airline_claim_kz): source_case_key has long type (required) | settlement_line has string type (required) | settlement_kzt has decimal type (required).
