4. supplier credit: when work_state equals "CREDIT", export CREDIT (-estimated_cost).
5. audited joint maintenance: when work_state equals "JOINT" and audit_needed is true, export DEPOT (estimated_cost*40/100) followed by CONTRACTOR (estimated_cost*60/100) followed by AUDIT (0).
6. over budget: when estimated_cost > spending_limit, export BUDGET_HOLD (estimated_cost-spending_limit).
7. joint maintenance: when work_state equals "JOINT", export DEPOT (estimated_cost*40/100) followed by CONTRACTOR (estimated_cost*60/100).
8. local maintenance: otherwise, export MAINTENANCE (estimated_cost).

Input 0 (In_transit_maintenance_0): work_order_number: type=long, required
