A pharmaceutical research network operating in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, needs a Reformat mapping for research-site coordination events. Copy coordination_id and extract the day of the month from recorded_at as local_day. Also supply English month labels Jan..Dec, weekday labels Mon..Sun, and a nonworking_day flag that is true on Friday or Saturday and false otherwise.

Set contact_window to "closed" on nonworking days; otherwise use "staffed" from 08:00 through 16:59 and "on_call" at all other times. All date and time calculations use Asia/Riyadh.

If recorded_at is null, set local_day, month_text, weekday_text, and nonworking_day to null, and set contact_window to "unknown".

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 NetworkEventInput: coordination_id long required, recorded_at date nullable
Output 0 NetworkEventOutput: coordination_id long required, local_day integer nullable, month_text string nullable, weekday_text string nullable, nonworking_day boolean nullable, contact_window string required

```ctl
