6. multi-night prepayment: when first_night_rate > 0 and prepaid_amount > first_night_rate, export FIRST_NIGHT (first_night_rate) followed by REMAINING_STAY (prepaid_amount-first_night_rate).
7. travel agency booking: when sales_channel equals "TRAVEL_AGENCY", export ROOM_REVENUE (prepaid_amount*0.85) followed by AGENCY_COMMISSION (prepaid_amount*0.15).
