Set ridership_class to UNKNOWN for null observed_riders, INVALID for negative values, QUIET for 0..49, and BUSY otherwise.

Set reconciliation_class to UNKNOWN if either count is null; otherwise INVALID if either count is negative or recorded_validations exceeds observed_riders; otherwise GAP if observed_riders exceeds recorded_validations; otherwise BALANCED.

stop_present means stop_label is nonblank after trimming. auditor_verified reports whether auditor_tag matches the exact AUD pattern, regardless of fare_exempt.

