For a restaurant billing system in Guatemala, use a REFORMAT component to audit invoice references and totals expressed in Guatemalan centavos (100 centavos = Q1).

Normalize bill_reference by trimming and uppercasing it into normalized_reference. If bill_reference is null, use an empty string. Match the entire normalized_reference against GT-[0-9]{6}. Set reference_ok to false with reference_note missing for null or empty text, false with reference_note format for a nonmatching value, and true with reference_note accepted otherwise. Copy invoice_key.

Classify total_centavos into balance_band: credit below 0, unpaid for 0, modest for 1..9999, standard for 10000..99999, and large from 100000. Set handling_rank to 8/0/1/2/4 respectively.

For positive totals, set whole_quetzales to the integer quotient of total_centavos divided by 100 and fractional_centavos to its remainder modulo 100. For nonpositive totals, set both to 0.

Set billing_step using the first applicable rule:
- correct_bill if the reference is invalid OR a positive total has a nonzero fractional_centavos.
- issue_credit if total_centavos is negative.
- cancel_bill if total_centavos is zero.
- issue_invoice otherwise.

Set billing_queue using the first applicable rule:
- reference_desk if the reference is invalid.
- credit_desk if total_centavos is negative.
- cash_rounding if fractional_centavos is nonzero.
- high_value if total_centavos is at least 100000.
- routine otherwise.

Set manual_check to true if the reference is invalid, the total is negative, OR both the total is at least 100000 and fractional_centavos is nonzero; otherwise false.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 RestaurantBillInput0: invoice_key string required, bill_reference string nullable, total_centavos long required
Output 0 RestaurantBillOutput0: invoice_key string required, normalized_reference string required, reference_ok boolean required, reference_note string required, balance_band string required, billing_step string required, whole_quetzales long required, fractional_centavos long required, handling_rank integer required, billing_queue string required, manual_check boolean required

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    string ref = "";
    long total = $in.0.total_centavos;
    long whole = 0L;
    long fraction = 0L;
    boolean valid = false;

    $out.0.invoice_key = $in.0.invoice_key;
    if (!isnull($in.0.bill_reference)) {
        ref = upperCase(trim($in.0.bill_reference));
    }
    $out.0.normalized_reference = ref;

    if (ref == "") {
        $out.0.reference_note = "missing";
    } else if (ref ~= "GT-[0-9]{6}") {
        valid = true;
        $out.0.reference_note = "accepted";
    } else {
        $out.0.reference_note = "format";
    }
    $out.0.reference_ok = valid;

    if (total < 0L) {
        $out.0.balance_band = "credit";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 8;
    } else if (total == 0L) {
        $out.0.balance_band = "unpaid";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 0;
    } else if (total < 10000L) {
        $out.0.balance_band = "modest";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 1;
    } else if (total < 100000L) {
        $out.0.balance_band = "standard";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 2;
    } else {
        $out.0.balance_band = "large";
        $out.0.handling_rank = 4;
    }

    if (total > 0L) {
        whole = total / 100L;
        fraction = total % 100L;
    }
    $out.0.whole_quetzales = whole;
    $out.0.fractional_centavos = fraction;

    if (!valid || (total > 0L && fraction != 0L)) {
        $out.0.billing_step = "correct_bill";
    } else if (total < 0L) {
        $out.0.billing_step = "issue_credit";
    } else if (total == 0L) {
        $out.0.billing_step = "cancel_bill";
    } else {
        $out.0.billing_step = "issue_invoice";
    }

    if (!valid) {
        $out.0.billing_queue = "reference_desk";
    } else if (total < 0L) {
        $out.0.billing_queue = "credit_desk";
    } else if (fraction != 0L) {
        $out.0.billing_queue = "cash_rounding";
    } else if (total >= 100000L) {
        $out.0.billing_queue = "high_value";
    } else {
        $out.0.billing_queue = "routine";
    }

    $out.0.manual_check = !valid || total < 0L || (total >= 100000L && fraction != 0L);
    return SKIP;
}
