prompt:
Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

Our Brazilian e-commerce booking platform needs this transform. All monetary amounts are in BRL.

Booking validation: copy booking_key; trim reservation_reference; classify null or empty as ABSENT, a whole-string mismatch to BR-[0-9]{6} as MALFORMED, otherwise ACCEPTED. Validate the trimmed text before uppercasing it. Also output its trimmed uppercase form, using an empty string for null, and booking_blocked, treating null as false.

Count one issue for each of these six conditions:
- reference_state is not ACCEPTED.
- booking_total is null or nonpositive.
- deposit_received is null, negative, or greater than a non-null booking_total.
- service_city is null or blank after trimming.
- seller_token does not match the exact whole-string pattern BR followed by four digits; null is a mismatch. Do not trim this field.
- booking_blocked is true.

Set fulfillment_lane to MANUAL_CHECK if any issue exists; otherwise CONFIRMED if deposit_received equals booking_total, otherwise AWAITING_BALANCE.

Set value_tier to UNSPECIFIED for null booking_total, INVALID for nonpositive values, PREMIUM for values at least BRL 1000, and REGULAR otherwise.

Set payment_stage to UNSPECIFIED if either monetary field is null; otherwise INVALID if booking_total is nonpositive, deposit_received is negative, or deposit_received exceeds booking_total; otherwise SETTLED if the two amounts are equal, UNPAID if deposit_received is zero, and PARTIAL otherwise.

city_present means service_city is nonblank after trimming; seller_verified uses the exact seller_token pattern above.

Component: REFORMAT.
Input 0: {"name": "BookingInput", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "booking_key", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "reservation_reference", "type": "string"}, {"name": "booking_total", "type": "decimal", "nullable": true}, {"name": "deposit_received", "type": "decimal", "nullable": true}, {"name": "booking_blocked", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "service_city", "type": "string"}, {"name": "seller_token", "type": "string"}]}
Output 0: {"name": "BookingResult", "type": "delimited", "fields": [{"name": "booking_key", "type": "long", "nullable": false}, {"name": "reference_state", "type": "string"}, {"name": "canonical_reference", "type": "string"}, {"name": "issue_count", "type": "integer", "nullable": false}, {"name": "fulfillment_lane", "type": "string"}, {"name": "value_tier", "type": "string"}, {"name": "payment_stage", "type": "string"}, {"name": "city_present", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "seller_verified", "type": "boolean"}, {"name": "booking_blocked", "type": "boolean"}]}

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    string ref = "";
    if (!isnull($in.0.reservation_reference)) {
        ref = trim($in.0.reservation_reference);
    }
    string state;
    if (ref == "") {
        state = "ABSENT";
    } else if (ref ~= "BR-[0-9]{6}") {
        state = "ACCEPTED";
    } else {
        state = "MALFORMED";
    }

    boolean cityPresent = false;
    if (!isnull($in.0.service_city)) {
        cityPresent = trim($in.0.service_city) != "";
    }
    boolean sellerVerified = false;
    if (!isnull($in.0.seller_token)) {
        sellerVerified = $in.0.seller_token ~= "BR[0-9]{4}";
    }
    boolean blocked = false;
    if (!isnull($in.0.booking_blocked)) {
        blocked = $in.0.booking_blocked;
    }

    decimal total = $in.0.booking_total;
    decimal deposit = $in.0.deposit_received;
    boolean totalInvalid = true;
    if (!isnull(total)) {
        totalInvalid = total <= 0;
    }
    boolean depositInvalid = true;
    if (!isnull(deposit)) {
        depositInvalid = deposit < 0;
        if (!isnull(total)) {
            if (deposit > total) depositInvalid = true;
        }
    }

    integer issues = 0;
    if (state != "ACCEPTED") issues++;
    if (totalInvalid) issues++;
    if (depositInvalid) issues++;
    if (!cityPresent) issues++;
    if (!sellerVerified) issues++;
    if (blocked) issues++;

    string lane;
    if (issues > 0) {
        lane = "MANUAL_CHECK";
    } else if (deposit == total) {
        lane = "CONFIRMED";
    } else {
        lane = "AWAITING_BALANCE";
    }

    string tier;
    if (isnull(total)) {
        tier = "UNSPECIFIED";
    } else if (total <= 0) {
        tier = "INVALID";
    } else if (total >= 1000) {
        tier = "PREMIUM";
    } else {
        tier = "REGULAR";
    }

    string stage;
    if (isnull(total) || isnull(deposit)) {
        stage = "UNSPECIFIED";
    } else if (total <= 0 || deposit < 0 || deposit > total) {
        stage = "INVALID";
    } else if (deposit == total) {
        stage = "SETTLED";
    } else if (deposit == 0) {
        stage = "UNPAID";
    } else {
        stage = "PARTIAL";
    }

    $out.0.booking_key = $in.0.booking_key;
    $out.0.reference_state = state;
    $out.0.canonical_reference = upperCase(ref);
    $out.0.issue_count = issues;
    $out.0.fulfillment_lane = lane;
    $out.0.value_tier = tier;
    $out.0.payment_stage = stage;
    $out.0.city_present = cityPresent;
    $out.0.seller_verified = sellerVerified;
    $out.0.booking_blocked = blocked;
    return ALL;
}
```

