The agriculture payment allocation export for a banana growers’ cooperative in Saint Lucia. All monetary values are in Eastern Caribbean dollars (XCD). Listed rules have precedence from top to bottom. Parentheses give the exact value for each named entry.

1. duplicate submission: when settlement_kind equals "DUPLICATE", export nothing.
2. invalid proceeds: when crop_proceeds < 0, export CORRECTION (-crop_proceeds).
3. missing payment destination: when bank_route is null or equals "", export nothing.
4. advance recovery: when settlement_kind equals "ADVANCE", export GROWER (crop_proceeds) followed by ADVANCE_RECOVERY (-advance_balance).
5. audited cooperative split: when settlement_kind equals "POOLED" and audit_selected and crop_proceeds > advance_balance, export GROWER ((crop_proceeds-advance_balance)*95/100) followed by COOPERATIVE ((crop_proceeds-advance_balance)*5/100) followed by AUDIT (0).
6. fully offset payment: when crop_proceeds <= advance_balance, export OFFSET (crop_proceeds).
7. cooperative split: when settlement_kind equals "POOLED", export GROWER ((crop_proceeds-advance_balance)*95/100) followed by COOPERATIVE ((crop_proceeds-advance_balance)*5/100).
8. direct payment: otherwise, export DIRECT (crop_proceeds-advance_balance).

Input 0 (In_banana_settlement_0): long / required / delivery_number; string / required / settlement_kind; decimal / required / crop_proceeds; decimal / required / advance_balance; boolean / required / audit_selected; string / nullable / bank_route.
Output 0 (Out_banana_settlement_0): long / required / delivery_reference; string / required / allocation_code; decimal / required / allocated_xcd.
Each source ID is unique; carry delivery_number into delivery_reference. Entry labels go in allocation_code, values in allocated_xcd. Assume advance_balance is nonnegative.

